# ~/.gitignore_global has 'Icon?' (intended for Mac Classic Icon\r files)
# which case-insensitively matches the 'icons' directory on macOS
# (HFS+/APFS are case-insensitive). Un-ignore so brand icons commit.
!assets/icons/
.wrangler/
